
▶ task: # TASK: Self-integrate — one workflow improvement

## Canonical tool flow — follow exactly

### Step 1: pick target
    glob(path="~/.github/workflows", glob="*.yml")
    gh(["run","list","--repo","timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo","--limit","20","--json","databaseId,name,conclusion,headBranch"])

### Step 2: read the file (ONE CALL — no shell, no b64_decode)
    gh_get_file(repo="timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo",
                path=".github/workflows/deepseek-termux-agent.yml",
                ref="master")

The `content` field IS the full decoded text. The `sha` field is what
gh_put will need — but gh_put auto-detects sha, so you do not need to
pass it. Save the ORIGINAL content; you will need it for revert.

### Step 3: pick ONE improvement
- missing `if: failure()` step -> add
- deprecated action version -> bump
- missing `timeout-minutes:` on a job -> add
- missing artifact upload of logs -> add

If the file already satisfies all of these, try `ci-sweep.yml`. If both
are clean, `finish` with improvement=null.

### Step 4: apply via gh_put (ONE CALL — the only write path)
    gh_put(repo="timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo",
           path=".github/workflows/deepseek-termux-agent.yml",
           content="<full new file body — original with exactly one change>",
           message="chore(ci): <one-line diagnosis>",
           branch="master")

### Step 5: validate
    gh(["workflow","run","deepseek-termux-agent.yml","--repo","timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo","--ref","master"])
    sleep via run: run(["sleep","30"])
    gh(["run","list","--repo","timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo","--workflow","deepseek-termux-agent.yml","--limit","1","--json","status,conclusion"])

### Step 6: sync logs and finish
    logs_sync()
    finish(summary='{"file":"...","change":"...","validation":"passed|reverted|deferred"}')

## Forbidden
- Do NOT use `run` with sh/bash/base64. They are not allowlisted and never will be.
- Do NOT try to pipe output through shell utilities.
- If a tool fails, move to the next approach; do not retry the same call.

## On failure
If after 6 tool calls you cannot complete step 4, call finish with
validation="deferred" and a one-sentence reason. That is a valid outcome.

